cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "SpectrumFog: a partially observable spectrum-electromagnetic simulation platform"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic simulation core for spectrum-electromagnetic scenarios: radar equation,
  jamming-to-signal ratio, burn-through range, Swerling I detection probability,
  fixed-step clock with seeded RNG, JSONL replay that reproduces byte-for-byte,
  and 2D top-down visualisation. All models use public textbook formulations
  evaluated with fictional parameters.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "郝"
    given-names: "仁昱"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - simulation
  - electronic-warfare
  - partial-observability
  - radar
  - spectrum
  - reproducible
